    "description": {
      "value": "Housing associations that want to stop heating apartment blocks with gas boilers can buy heat from Heliwarm Systems for a fixed monthly fee instead of buying equipment: Heliwarm installs, owns and runs centralised heat pumps in the buildings. Its control software pools the buildings into a virtual power plant and sells their ability to shift electricity demand to grid operators. The Series B pays for growth into Germany and for the platform team.",
      "source": "synthetic",
